[2026-03-16T03:12:02.617Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016zBHfXTbPPgpSatgjxSVGM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All accessibility work for the Home/Search page is complete. Here's a summary of changes:\n\n**SearchBar**: Added `role=\"search\"`, `aria-label`, `htmlFor`/`id` on all labels/inputs, hidden sr-only labels for date inputs, `aria-hidden` on decorative dividers and icon\n\n**CategoryFilter**: Added `role=\"group\"`, `aria-label`, `aria-pressed` on toggle buttons\n\n**FiltersPanel**: Added `aria-expanded` on toggle, `role=\"dialog\"` and `aria-label` on panel, `aria-label` on close button, `htmlFor`/`id` on all form labels, `fieldset`/`legend` for field groups, Escape key to close, `aria-hidden` on icons\n\n**PropertyGrid**: Added `role=\"status\"` and `aria-live=\"polite\"` on loading state, sr-only loading text, `role=\"status\"` on empty state, semantic `<section>` with `aria-label`\n\n**PropertyCard**: Replaced clickable `<div>` with semantic `<article>` + `<Link>`, added descriptive `aria-label`, `aria-hidden` on Star icon, focus-visible ring\n\n**Pagination**: Added `aria-label` on nav, `aria-label` on page buttons, `aria-current=\"page\"` on active page, `aria-hidden` on icons and ellipsis\n\n**Home**: Added visually hidden `<h1>` heading\n\n**Sidebar**: Added `aria-label` on nav and logo link, `aria-expanded` and `aria-label` on menu button, Escape key to close dropdown, `aria-hidden` on icons\n\n**FavoriteButton**: Added `aria-hidden` on Heart icon\n\n<DONE>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":450,"cache_read_input_tokens":75614,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":450,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7cf5a2ff-0ab5-4175-9389-38775b817822","uuid":"c9cd2574-d550-4151-80ff-